Revision history for Perl extension Text::Fab.

0.01		  Fri Sep  5 07:50:43 2025
	- original version; created by h2xs 1.23 with options
		-Xn Text::Fab

	A lot of technical work on the stub implementation, documentation and the test suite was passed to Gemini 2.5 Pro
		(with 32K thinking budget + very delicate system instructions).

	The implementation supports the most basic parts of processing pipeline only.  Only the pure-config__* subsystem is
	covered by the test suite.

0.02	Reworked with Gemini 3.8 Flash Medium (and one iteration with High) in a pure-chat in AI Studio; no system instructions.
	The only target was to make the test suite to match the docs (and fix the implementation accordingly).
	Only the updates to the docs checked by a human.
	The model claims that all the APIs (except Control Flow, Loops, Caching, Root Directives) are implemented and covered by
	the test suite.

0.03	Continue reworking with Gemini 3.8 Flash Medium in a pure-chat in AI Studio; no system instructions.
	Restore the original comments in the code.  Add new comments likewise.
	Fix a mismatch of the semantic of preserved blinding lists with what is written in the docs.
	Fix the scalar set/append with multiple arguments (only one allowed), allow string "offset" for hashes.
	Implement priority-based group__postpone; support insertion of undo actions from undo actions.
	Even if errors happen, all the postponed actions are performed.
